      "value": "The cam is pointing in the correct position if you create worlds. It looks into the scene. For Avatars it has to look at \"you\". So I guess its the best to create a new (default avatar)project and change the cam prefab to your preferred position.\n\nEDIT: Maybe the Avatar Descriptor component can move and rotate it once we click upload in the next version of the sdk....",
